title: Add the pallet-jamkb prototype and its pallet-revive precompile
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds `pallet-jamkb`, a prototype FRAME pallet managing the Asset Hub representation of
      JAMKB, the state-footprint token of JAM. It covers the permanent release, holder
      redemption and voluntary return flows, the governance corrections and the asynchronous
      operation machinery they rely on. Leases and lease recovery are not implemented.

      The transport to JAM is behind the traits in `pallet_jamkb::transport`; the pallet
      ships with placeholder weights and no benchmarks. Nothing is wired into a runtime yet.

      Adds `pallet-jamkb-precompiles`, which exposes the holder calls of the pallet to
      contracts through `pallet-revive` at the fixed address `0x…0903_0000` (`IJamkb.sol`).
crates:
  - name: pallet-jamkb
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-jamkb-precompiles
    bump: minor
